  \\(A Z = B\\). Notice that the fast path is only numerically stable when
  \\(A\\) is numerically full rank and has a condition number
  \\(\mathrm{cond}(A) \lt \frac{1}{\sqrt{\epsilon_{mach}}}\\) or\\(\lambda\\)
  is sufficiently large.

